ENABLE
CONF T
HOSTNAME Branch-Core-3650
NO ENABLE PASSWORD
ENABLE SECRET CISCO

IP ROUTING

VLAN 10
NAME RJ_SUPERVISAO
VLAN 20
NAME RJ_OPERATIONS
VLAN 99
NAME RJ_MGMT
VLAN 200
NAME RJ_TRANSIT_L3
EXIT

INT VLAN 10
IP ADDRESS 172.19.0.1 255.255.254.0
NO SHUT
INT VLAN 20
IP ADDRESS 172.19.2.1 255.255.254.0
NO SHUT
INT VLAN 99
IP ADDRESS 172.19.99.1 255.255.255.0
NO SHUT
INT VLAN 200
IP ADDRESS 172.19.4.1 255.255.255.252
NO SHUT
EXIT

IP DHCP EXCLUDED-ADDRESS 172.19.0.1 172.19.0.50
IP DHCP EXCLUDED-ADDRESS 172.19.2.1 172.19.2.50

IP DHCP POOL POOL_RJ_SUPERVISAO
NETWORK 172.19.0.0 255.255.254.0
DEFAULT-ROUTER 172.19.0.1
DNS-SERVER 172.16.32.10
EXIT

IP DHCP POOL POOL_RJ_OPERATIONS
NETWORK 172.19.2.0 255.255.254.0
DEFAULT-ROUTER 172.19.2.1
DNS-SERVER 172.16.32.10
EXIT

INT G1/0/1
SWITCHPORT MODE TRUNK
SWITCHPORT TRUNK ALLOWED VLAN 10,20,99
NO SHUT
EXIT

INT G1/0/2
SWITCHPORT MODE ACCESS
SWITCHPORT ACCESS VLAN 200
NO SHUT
EXIT

ROUTER OSPF 1
ROUTER-ID 4.4.4.4
NETWORK 172.19.0.0 0.0.1.255 AREA 0
NETWORK 172.19.2.0 0.0.1.255 AREA 0
NETWORK 172.19.99.0 0.0.0.255 AREA 0
NETWORK 172.19.4.0 0.0.0.3 AREA 0
EXIT

IP ROUTE 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 172.19.4.2

IP DOMAIN-NAME ANBIMA.CORP
CRYPTO KEY GENERATE RSA
2048
IP SSH VERSION 2
USERNAME ADMIN PRIVILEGE 15 SECRET ANBIMA@SEC2026!
LINE VTY 0 4
LOGIN LOCAL
TRANSPORT INPUT SSH
IP SSH TIME-OUT 60
IP SSH AUTHENTICATION-RETRIES 4
EXIT
